# Build context ALLOWLIST (review #15) for every image built from the repo root
# (Dockerfile.release via docker-bake.hcl, tooling/test-runner/Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded unless listed: .env*, .ciu/secrets, databases, deploy trees and
# worktrees never reach the builder. Add a path here when a Dockerfile starts to COPY it.
*
!src/
!gunicorn.conf.py
!requirements-runtime.txt
!requirements-test.txt
# Bind-mounted for one RUN step of Dockerfile.release only (renders app-defaults.env); never
# copied into a layer.
!.env.defaults
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
